WEBVTT

00:59.971 --> 01:01.803
Hold on.

01:03.333 --> 01:06.213
I should head in now.

01:06.213 --> 01:07.834
Get home safe.

01:07.834 --> 01:09.691
I still have something to say.

01:09.691 --> 01:11.949
What is it?

01:12.876 --> 01:15.532
You told me to go after what I love.

01:15.532 --> 01:17.455
I like you.

01:19.306 --> 01:20.325
What?

01:20.325 --> 01:23.120
I know I'm probably not much
of a dating prospect right now.

01:23.120 --> 01:25.372
But I'm going to really give acting
everything I've got.

01:25.372 --> 01:26.966
I already have an audition lined up,

01:26.966 --> 01:29.383
and I'm going to keep going until I make it.

01:31.376 --> 01:32.463
Hey...

01:32.463 --> 01:34.590
I'll dress well

01:34.590 --> 01:37.083
so I won't be embarrassed standing next to you.

01:37.083 --> 01:38.549
I'll move into

01:38.549 --> 01:41.134
a decent place so you can come over.

01:41.134 --> 01:43.556
Places like that restaurant tonight...

01:43.556 --> 01:46.810
Maybe not all the time, but on special days,

01:46.810 --> 01:48.694
I'll take you somewhere nice.

01:50.792 --> 01:52.865
I want to...

01:54.568 --> 01:56.660
be in love with you.

02:02.760 --> 02:05.044
Well...

02:08.582 --> 02:10.466
Mr. Tae Seop?

02:14.917 --> 02:16.298
Exactly what is this right now?

02:16.298 --> 02:18.761
Why should that matter to you?

02:18.761 --> 02:19.801
You don't think it matters?

02:19.801 --> 02:23.221
You're aware Ui Yeong and I are involved.

02:23.221 --> 02:24.920
I told you it bothers me

02:24.920 --> 02:27.167
when you hang around Ui Yeong all the time.

02:27.167 --> 02:29.520
I said it bothers me.

02:29.520 --> 02:32.523
Sure, that's how it was before.

02:33.256 --> 02:35.375
The thing is, I have feelings for Ui Yeong too.

02:35.375 --> 02:37.861
That means I can't afford to care how you feel,

02:37.861 --> 02:40.287
and I've got no intention of stepping aside.

02:42.750 --> 02:45.126
Tae Seop.

02:45.744 --> 02:47.917
Hey, all three of you!

02:47.917 --> 02:49.623
Good evening.

02:49.623 --> 02:51.864
My goodness, what's going on at this hour?

02:51.864 --> 02:54.583
The poor girl's face is completely pale.

02:54.583 --> 02:57.464
- Is someone bothering you?
- No, nothing like that.

02:57.464 --> 03:00.224
- You want me to call someone?
- No, please don't.

03:01.542 --> 03:04.758
I was heading in right now, actually.

03:04.758 --> 03:06.730
Alright, get inside.

03:07.834 --> 03:10.401
We'll each get our answer separately.

03:11.250 --> 03:13.188
I'm sorry.

03:13.188 --> 03:14.739
Go on in.

03:14.739 --> 03:18.078
Alright, I'll go in now.

03:18.078 --> 03:19.660
Sure.

03:22.989 --> 03:24.938
Ui Yeong!

03:24.938 --> 03:28.043
Think about what I said.

03:44.761 --> 03:46.812
You're not leaving?

03:51.810 --> 03:54.335
[Episode 8]

03:54.335 --> 03:55.772
I'm back.

03:55.772 --> 03:57.557
Oh, welcome home.

03:57.557 --> 03:59.038
Heading back from work?

03:59.038 --> 04:02.058
No, I met up with a friend after work.

04:02.058 --> 04:03.363
Seung Jun?

04:03.363 --> 04:06.625
Did you exercise with him and end up like that?

04:06.625 --> 04:09.119
Mom, I'm wiped out. Let me just crash.

04:09.119 --> 04:11.921
- Night.
- Alright.

04:22.333 --> 04:24.248
On a blind date like this,

04:24.248 --> 04:27.686
nobody expects things to turn out this way.

04:51.813 --> 04:54.853
It should've been me making the first move,

04:54.853 --> 04:57.675
but another guy got there before me.

05:33.748 --> 05:35.667
These feelings are something

05:35.667 --> 05:37.881
completely new to me.

05:40.043 --> 05:42.303
As if being new to this changes anything.

05:45.125 --> 05:47.458
Forget what logic tells you,

05:47.458 --> 05:50.144
just go where your feelings point.

05:57.375 --> 05:59.917
Exactly. Press hard enough

05:59.917 --> 06:02.031
and gaps start to appear.

06:07.198 --> 06:10.998
I'll show you a way better time than that guy.

06:26.506 --> 06:28.841
[I'll show you a way better time than that guy]

06:32.250 --> 06:34.646
Seriously, I'm losing my mind.

06:58.486 --> 07:01.708
The disposable amenity supply
we have is nearly depleted,

07:01.708 --> 07:03.422
which means
we should submit a new purchase order.

07:03.422 --> 07:05.837
The resource recycling act has been
around for years now.

07:05.837 --> 07:07.881
About time we burned through the old stock.

07:07.881 --> 07:10.802
Every other hotel's been swapping
theirs gradually, no?

07:10.802 --> 07:13.345
That's right. A few charge
about one or two thousand won

07:13.345 --> 07:15.642
for formerly complimentary items,

07:15.642 --> 07:17.974
while others offer green
or upscale alternatives

07:17.974 --> 07:19.442
for a premium.

07:19.442 --> 07:21.902
What's your take on this, Ui Yeong?

07:21.902 --> 07:23.779
What do you...

07:24.417 --> 07:26.066
Ui Yeong?

07:26.066 --> 07:27.805
Ui Yeong?

07:27.805 --> 07:28.818
Oh, yes?

07:28.818 --> 07:30.737
Oh, right.

07:30.737 --> 07:33.167
It really comes down

07:33.167 --> 07:35.417
to viewing amenities as hospitality

07:35.417 --> 07:38.988
versus treating them as merchandise.

07:38.988 --> 07:41.542
In my view,
the hospitality approach makes more sense.

07:41.542 --> 07:43.188
Is that so? What's the reasoning?

07:43.188 --> 07:46.792
If they're gone, guests immediately feel
inconvenienced and put off,

07:46.792 --> 07:49.381
and people might see that as a sign

07:49.381 --> 07:51.758
that our hotel isn't keeping up its standards.

07:51.758 --> 07:53.927
Fair enough.

07:53.927 --> 07:55.125
So what should we do?

07:55.125 --> 07:57.604
Right, what should we do?

08:01.000 --> 08:02.934
You never cease to amaze me.

08:02.934 --> 08:06.606
How can you drift off completely
and then come right back like nothing happened?

08:06.606 --> 08:08.449
Could you tell?

08:09.108 --> 08:12.153
Shop talk flows out of me naturally,

08:12.153 --> 08:16.676
so why do feelings only get messier
the deeper I dig?

08:16.676 --> 08:17.957
Want to step outside for a bit?

08:17.957 --> 08:19.500
Maybe a cup of coffee?

08:19.500 --> 08:21.637
Sure, coffee would be...

08:21.637 --> 08:22.664
Never mind that.

08:22.664 --> 08:25.333
No coffee for me today.

08:25.333 --> 08:27.670
Go take your break. I'll wrap things up.

08:31.047 --> 08:33.041
Thanks.

08:33.041 --> 08:34.752
Lee Ui Yeong?

08:35.802 --> 08:37.012
Ui Yeong.

08:37.012 --> 08:39.250
Someone sent this your way.

08:39.250 --> 08:42.304
It was ordered under Song Tae Seop's name.

08:42.304 --> 08:44.352
- Let me grab one of those.
- Of course.

08:44.352 --> 08:46.000
Since when are the two of you friendly enough

08:46.000 --> 08:49.072
to be exchanging morning coffees?

08:50.358 --> 08:51.485
Ui Yeong,

08:51.485 --> 08:53.314
the air quality is pretty poor today.

08:53.314 --> 08:55.071
Staying indoors would be better.

08:55.071 --> 08:56.254
Wishing you a good one today.

08:56.254 --> 08:57.633
Check this out.

08:57.633 --> 08:58.825
Oh, coffee?

08:58.825 --> 09:00.923
Wait, who sent that coffee?

09:00.923 --> 09:05.096
Ji Su sent these for the whole team.

09:05.096 --> 09:07.000
And he said,

09:07.000 --> 09:08.581
"No more coffee from other places.

09:08.581 --> 09:10.962
If you won't show up, I'm coming to get you."

09:10.962 --> 09:12.562
He told me to pass that along.

09:12.562 --> 09:14.843
What's going on? That's weird.

09:14.843 --> 09:18.702
Since when did coffee become a competition?

09:18.702 --> 09:22.404
Please, it's nothing. They're only drinks.

09:22.404 --> 09:23.964
Just a coincidence.

09:23.964 --> 09:26.686
- Coincidence.
- Hey, works for us.

09:26.686 --> 09:28.325
Coffee's flowing like water.

09:28.325 --> 09:30.948
Flowing like water.

09:37.489 --> 09:40.201
Part of me wished this was all just random.

09:40.201 --> 09:41.750
- A meeting?
- Yeah.

09:41.750 --> 09:44.412
But that coffee turned out to be
the opening move in a long battle.

09:44.412 --> 09:45.956
Your button's undone.

09:45.956 --> 09:48.332
I undid it because of you.

09:48.332 --> 09:51.127
One guy determined to throw me off balance.

09:51.795 --> 09:53.714
Quite the spectacle.

09:57.667 --> 09:59.801
Oh, I should get going.

09:59.801 --> 10:01.041
Have a good date.

10:01.041 --> 10:02.180
See you.

10:02.180 --> 10:03.431
Tae Seop.

10:03.431 --> 10:05.841
Let me drive you since I'm passing by your way.

10:05.841 --> 10:07.375
Haven't you eaten?

10:07.375 --> 10:08.562
No, not really.

10:08.562 --> 10:11.989
And one who refuses to budge, no matter what.

10:13.149 --> 10:14.582
Make it to the office alright?

10:14.582 --> 10:17.801
Seeing blue skies this morning
put me in a great mood.

10:17.801 --> 10:20.406
Even with a packed schedule,
glance up once in a while.

10:20.406 --> 10:22.583
[Lunch Greeting]
Have a good day.

10:23.171 --> 10:24.911
Seems like the day barely started,

10:24.911 --> 10:26.496
yet it's lunch hour already.

10:26.496 --> 10:28.331
Make sure you eat even if things are hectic.

10:28.331 --> 10:31.209
Chew slowly so everything settles right.

10:31.209 --> 10:33.552
Good luck with the afternoon.

10:35.589 --> 10:39.102
[You've got this!]

10:40.343 --> 10:44.640
A man who's consistent
and sincere, even in his flirting.

10:46.349 --> 10:48.268
[Ui Yeong! What's up? You busy?]

10:48.268 --> 10:51.290
You must be craving a coffee after lunch.

10:51.290 --> 10:53.440
I'll have your favorite latte ready.

10:53.440 --> 10:54.690
Come grab a coffee.

10:54.690 --> 10:58.660
And a man who just barges in
whenever he pleases.

11:06.958 --> 11:08.962
Here are your orders.

11:52.794 --> 11:54.508
Ui Yeong.

11:55.961 --> 11:57.671
Lee Ui Yeong!

12:13.836 --> 12:16.094
Traveling here was pointless. Such a shame.

12:16.094 --> 12:17.694
This leaves me feeling much more hollow.

12:17.694 --> 12:20.015
Productivity doesn't matter for things I love.

12:20.015 --> 12:23.928
We'll see if this is actually pointless.

12:23.928 --> 12:25.458
Sure, then.

12:25.458 --> 12:27.207
You do that.

12:34.040 --> 12:36.458
Having the chicken feet restaurant owner
as a mother-in-law,

12:36.458 --> 12:38.489
- or a popular star?
- Don't do that.

12:38.489 --> 12:40.389
We need to outlaw those preference games.

12:40.389 --> 12:43.424
Never mind just favoring a specific side.

12:43.424 --> 12:45.876
Playing this completely ruins people. Quit it.

12:45.876 --> 12:48.792
I've never seen someone
keep two guys on the hook

12:48.792 --> 12:51.069
and feel so terrible about it.

12:51.069 --> 12:53.417
Playing the field requires a real gift, right?

12:53.417 --> 12:55.110
Leading them on...

12:55.876 --> 12:59.614
Why am I leading them on like this?

13:00.333 --> 13:01.923
I don't know.

13:01.923 --> 13:04.278
How can trapped minnows like us

13:04.278 --> 13:07.164
possibly understand the ones fishing?

13:08.158 --> 13:11.001
Hold on, what makes you include me in this?

13:11.625 --> 13:12.923
Just because.

13:12.923 --> 13:16.323
Yet they're fortunate just to be in your net.

13:16.323 --> 13:19.264
I might simply resemble a tiny little fish
swimming among a massive group of others.

13:19.264 --> 13:21.845
It's an anchovy.

13:24.307 --> 13:26.425
Man, my belly hurts.

13:26.425 --> 13:29.853
Eating spicy food just to complain
about the stomachache.

13:33.141 --> 13:35.288
I'm craving
that Songi Spicy Chicken Feet place now.

13:35.288 --> 13:38.707
The heat that completely dissolves my tension.

13:38.707 --> 13:41.542
This artificial spice can't even compare.

13:41.542 --> 13:43.792
Hey, but that lady there...

13:43.792 --> 13:44.895
No, never mind.

13:44.895 --> 13:47.116
Do you think the owner's been waiting around

13:47.116 --> 13:49.356
feeling sad that we haven't come by?

13:49.356 --> 13:50.792
How do you come to a new place

13:50.792 --> 13:52.476
and still only think about the old one?

13:52.476 --> 13:54.556
You're way too soft-hearted.

13:54.556 --> 13:57.855
That's why those guys keep throwing
new moves at you every day.

13:57.855 --> 13:59.856
Gosh, you think so?

13:59.856 --> 14:02.336
Quit getting fooled by their petty maneuvers

14:02.336 --> 14:04.723
and simply choose the more powerful guy.

14:04.723 --> 14:06.424
- Whose thighs are bigger?
- What?

14:06.424 --> 14:08.364
They may look the same now,
but a decade later...

14:08.364 --> 14:09.625
Am I supposed to check? Really?

14:09.625 --> 14:11.884
Should I make them thigh-wrestle or something?

14:11.884 --> 14:13.431
If it comes to that, absolutely.

14:13.431 --> 14:18.000
Those men are nervous enough
to want it resolved however they can.

14:18.000 --> 14:20.862
So pull yourself together.

14:21.689 --> 14:23.490
Got it.

14:26.695 --> 14:29.024
Alright, let's head out.
I have a PT session to teach soon.

14:29.024 --> 14:32.124
- I should get going.
- Right, let's move.

14:33.120 --> 14:35.661
Seung Jun, when are you off today?

14:35.661 --> 14:37.038
Mind if I stop by the gym?

14:37.038 --> 14:39.840
I've got an errand in the area.

14:41.376 --> 14:43.135
I can do this!

14:47.132 --> 14:50.000
I was trying to remember
where I'd seen her before, and then it hit me.

14:50.000 --> 14:51.469
From the app.

14:51.469 --> 14:53.820
She's someone I matched with on the app.

14:53.820 --> 14:57.023
She once told me my forearms were cute.

15:03.417 --> 15:05.198
Seung Jun.

15:07.458 --> 15:09.446
A heads-up before showing up
would've been nice.

15:09.446 --> 15:10.858
I tried.

15:10.858 --> 15:13.665
You must've been too swamped to notice.

15:14.250 --> 15:15.292
Well, the thing is...

15:15.292 --> 15:17.912
I don't really look
at my phone while I'm working.

15:17.912 --> 15:20.678
Which is exactly why I showed up myself.

15:20.678 --> 15:23.299
Is it cool if I exercise here
until you're done?

15:23.299 --> 15:24.744
There are single-day passes, right?

15:24.744 --> 15:26.545
We do, sure, but...

15:26.545 --> 15:28.423
there are a lot of people in today, so maybe

15:28.423 --> 15:29.965
just hang out at the cafe nearby...

15:29.965 --> 15:32.164
- Ice Box!
- Oh, right!

15:32.164 --> 15:34.265
- Should I get you signed up for a day pass?
- That'd be great.

15:34.265 --> 15:36.945
For a VIP like you,
I'll hook you up with a discount.

15:36.945 --> 15:39.065
I appreciate it!

15:40.876 --> 15:43.725
Honestly, just join full-time.
This gym could use the glow.

15:43.725 --> 15:44.897
- Maybe I will?
- Hey, part-timer.

15:44.897 --> 15:47.782
Nobody asked you to upsell.

15:50.152 --> 15:52.301
Well...

15:52.301 --> 15:55.809
This thing's big enough to sleep under.

15:55.809 --> 15:57.988
It's massive.

15:57.988 --> 16:01.083
Keeping the warmth in helps your muscles relax.

16:01.083 --> 16:04.167
Start with 30 minutes on the assault bike.

16:04.167 --> 16:06.083
I came to do some weight training.

16:06.083 --> 16:09.448
I deliberately walked over
to squeeze in 20 minutes of cardio.

16:09.448 --> 16:10.789
Hold on, are you an expert?

16:10.789 --> 16:13.228
I'm an expert.

16:13.228 --> 16:17.135
Man, I seriously hate doing cardio.

16:17.135 --> 16:20.148
Come on, quick. Go change and get out here.

16:37.141 --> 16:39.865
- You came from the restaurant?
- Yeah.

16:39.865 --> 16:41.413
Your mom looked after Sua.

16:41.413 --> 16:44.285
If you were heading straight home too,
we should've come together.

16:44.876 --> 16:47.942
Mom looked like she was dying to know

16:47.942 --> 16:49.336
what's up with you and Ui Yeong.

16:49.336 --> 16:51.673
I did go see Ui Yeong,

16:51.673 --> 16:52.826
but we barely crossed paths.

16:52.826 --> 16:56.003
All I saw was the one person
I didn't want to see.

16:56.003 --> 16:57.368
- The part-timer?
- Yeah.

16:57.368 --> 16:58.972
What a punk.

16:58.972 --> 17:01.167
Sua, get the tools ready.

17:01.167 --> 17:03.275
Let's go handle him.

17:03.930 --> 17:05.747
I got dragged into it.

17:05.747 --> 17:07.428
I had feelings for someone,

17:07.428 --> 17:09.990
I wasn't out to one-up anybody.

17:11.208 --> 17:14.087
Feel better.

17:14.087 --> 17:17.580
No matter what you do, just be you.

17:23.792 --> 17:25.797
Just be me...

17:30.458 --> 17:32.804
That tteokbokki was a mistake.

17:33.551 --> 17:35.231
- Hey, Mom.
- Yeah?

17:35.231 --> 17:38.226
Is there anything for an upset stomach?

17:39.333 --> 17:41.311
If you don't see it, we're probably out.

17:41.311 --> 17:42.652
Why, is your stomach hurting bad?

17:42.652 --> 17:45.031
Yeah, a little.

17:45.031 --> 17:47.478
I can't take this.

17:47.478 --> 17:50.030
Let me lie down for a while.

17:51.458 --> 17:52.952
You think you'll be all right?

17:52.952 --> 17:54.576
Yeah.

18:06.609 --> 18:09.841
Have you had dinner, Ui Yeong?

18:11.229 --> 18:14.004
I did, I ate and came back.

18:14.004 --> 18:17.974
I've got a bit of a stomachache right now
so I'm resting.

18:22.721 --> 18:24.000
Yes, Tae Seop?

18:24.000 --> 18:25.610
Could we chat for a minute?

18:25.610 --> 18:27.518
What kind of stomachache is it?

18:27.518 --> 18:30.000
It's not a big deal, really.

18:30.000 --> 18:31.773
My stomach hasn't been great these days,

18:31.773 --> 18:33.233
and I went and had something spicy.

18:33.233 --> 18:34.738
Have you taken any medicine?

18:34.738 --> 18:36.818
I ran out of medicine, actually.

18:36.818 --> 18:41.031
But I just need some sleep and I'll be okay.

18:41.031 --> 18:43.737
Right, but if it hurts, you won't sleep well.

18:43.737 --> 18:45.543
Give me a moment.

18:46.834 --> 18:48.438
Hello?

18:48.438 --> 18:50.090
Tae Seop...

18:50.798 --> 18:52.759
Did he hang up?

18:54.834 --> 18:57.555
My stomach.

19:04.710 --> 19:06.265
Oh, Ui Yeong.

19:06.265 --> 19:08.170
Tae Seop.

19:08.170 --> 19:09.811
I grabbed some chamomile for you.

19:09.811 --> 19:12.856
Oh, yes. Thank you.

19:12.856 --> 19:16.400
You came here just to get me that?

19:16.400 --> 19:17.943
Yes.

19:17.943 --> 19:19.370
Thank you.

19:19.370 --> 19:21.121
It's nothing.

19:24.041 --> 19:26.292
The night air feels nice.

19:27.550 --> 19:30.874
An ice cream right now
would really hit the spot.

19:30.874 --> 19:33.934
My mom and I take out the recycling
and pick one up sometimes.

19:34.899 --> 19:37.923
Looks like your stomach's
doing okay now, though.

19:37.923 --> 19:40.258
Oh, it is.

19:40.258 --> 19:42.725
That's all because of you.

19:43.385 --> 19:45.430
I've heard stress messes with your stomach.

19:45.430 --> 19:47.999
Sounds like I'm the one
who caused the pain and brought the fix.

19:47.999 --> 19:50.644
No, that's not what happened.

19:50.644 --> 19:52.250
I'm aware.

19:52.250 --> 19:54.904
I tried to hold back, but I needed to see you.

20:02.083 --> 20:03.746
Look

20:04.500 --> 20:06.916
I have feelings for you.

20:08.870 --> 20:10.162
People say when you go on blind dates,

20:10.162 --> 20:12.948
you're supposed to know
your feelings by the third one.

20:12.948 --> 20:16.085
I didn't think that could
actually happen in only three meetings,

20:16.085 --> 20:17.844
but it can.

20:19.375 --> 20:20.756
The thing is,

20:20.756 --> 20:22.948
the last few days I've been
so wrapped up in how I feel

20:22.948 --> 20:25.810
that I probably haven't
thought enough about yours.

20:26.625 --> 20:30.083
That kind of consideration is too much for me

20:30.083 --> 20:31.834
to ask for right now.

20:31.834 --> 20:34.736
That's fine. You just need
a little longer to figure things out.

20:36.037 --> 20:38.257
I can hold on.

20:38.257 --> 20:41.743
Once I commit to something,
I'm surprisingly good at being patient.

20:46.125 --> 20:47.500
Well...

20:47.500 --> 20:49.334
Could you give me your hand?

20:55.750 --> 20:58.384
But once you've made up your mind,

20:59.083 --> 21:01.596
don't hold back. Come find me.

21:15.520 --> 21:17.547
Stay just like that. Five.

21:17.547 --> 21:19.786
Breathe out when you pull back.

21:19.786 --> 21:22.286
Six.

21:22.286 --> 21:26.083
Keep that position. Seven.

21:26.083 --> 21:27.267
Sorry, just a second.

21:27.267 --> 21:29.207
Right, don't stop.

21:30.458 --> 21:32.566
Hyun Min, nice job.

21:32.566 --> 21:34.507
Okay, let's move to another bike now.

21:34.507 --> 21:36.667
Are you kidding?
I've been at it until the sun set.

21:36.667 --> 21:37.750
Can't I try something different?

21:37.750 --> 21:40.917
You get better results
if you power through it all in one go.

21:40.917 --> 21:42.845
All right, hop on.

21:43.917 --> 21:46.099
You've got this.

21:47.756 --> 21:49.053
There you go, perfect.

21:49.053 --> 21:50.208
Hey, Seung Jun.

21:50.208 --> 21:53.637
So if my legs give out,
you'll piggyback me home?

21:53.637 --> 21:55.136
Without question.

21:55.136 --> 21:58.333
All right, get your feet on, fast.

21:58.333 --> 22:00.530
Drive it from your abs.

22:01.233 --> 22:03.349
Good, maintain that speed.

22:10.157 --> 22:11.367
You did amazing today.

22:11.367 --> 22:13.232
Nice effort.

22:18.082 --> 22:19.126
Have a safe trip back.

22:19.126 --> 22:21.551
- Nice effort.
- See you.

22:24.528 --> 22:26.629
Right from that spot, only five left.

22:26.629 --> 22:28.943
Take it easy and steady.

22:30.834 --> 22:34.125
Two, three.

22:34.125 --> 22:37.525
Four, five.

22:38.292 --> 22:39.667
There we go.

22:39.667 --> 22:41.292
Extend it out completely.

22:41.292 --> 22:43.005
Nice.

22:43.005 --> 22:46.545
Twenty. All right, other side now.

22:46.545 --> 22:49.012
Tighten your abs.

22:49.012 --> 22:51.748
Breathe out and contract as you pull back.

22:52.834 --> 22:54.959
Three.

22:56.804 --> 22:58.421
Four.

22:59.248 --> 23:01.792
- I've been wearing these shoes so much.
- Oh, these shoes.

23:01.792 --> 23:03.593
These are a perfect fit.
So where are you off to?

23:03.593 --> 23:05.386
I'm heading in this direction.

23:13.264 --> 23:15.115
- Wait, for real?
- For real.

23:15.115 --> 23:18.055
That explains the muscles.

23:18.780 --> 23:21.834
- Do you have a private trainer then?
- No, I don't take private sessions.

23:21.834 --> 23:23.701
I head over this way.

23:23.701 --> 23:24.917
Oh, I see.

23:24.917 --> 23:27.659
- Catch you later.
- Sure thing. Get home safe.

23:31.917 --> 23:34.832
Seriously? Where's she headed now?

23:58.223 --> 24:00.525
- Hello.
- Hello.

24:06.584 --> 24:07.876
What?

24:07.876 --> 24:10.159
Don't tell me there's another guy.

24:13.500 --> 24:15.540
What are they talking about?

24:24.750 --> 24:27.039
Oh, you scared me.

24:27.039 --> 24:28.720
What the...

24:32.750 --> 24:34.400
Seung Jun?

24:34.400 --> 24:37.917
Were you following me? How come?

24:37.917 --> 24:40.220
Well...

24:40.220 --> 24:43.109
The thing is...

24:45.379 --> 24:47.417
Somebody from the gym

24:47.417 --> 24:50.575
spotted you on a dating app.

24:51.193 --> 24:53.578
Someone from the gym?

24:55.073 --> 24:56.779
So?

24:57.785 --> 25:01.335
You literally left the gym
with that guy just now.

25:02.037 --> 25:04.726
I didn't connect with him
through a dating app, though?

25:04.726 --> 25:07.383
He said for sure it was an app...

25:08.753 --> 25:10.417
An app...

25:10.417 --> 25:12.047
What?

25:12.047 --> 25:13.606
Soonmu Market.

25:13.606 --> 25:15.626
He purchased running shoes from me.

25:15.626 --> 25:17.505
His feet are on the smaller side.

25:17.505 --> 25:20.264
I list things I don't need anymore,

25:20.264 --> 25:22.225
and pick up what I do.

25:22.225 --> 25:23.934
Hang on,

25:23.934 --> 25:25.693
so earlier too...

25:29.333 --> 25:32.125
I purchased the comics that you tore up.

25:32.125 --> 25:35.328
I was after a full collection.

25:36.125 --> 25:38.411
Gosh.

25:39.167 --> 25:42.667
- I panicked for no reason.
- What?

25:42.667 --> 25:44.580
I thought

25:44.580 --> 25:46.170
you were the type
who just swipes on dating apps

25:46.170 --> 25:48.460
and hooks up with whoever,

25:48.460 --> 25:50.845
and I was stressing out so much over it.

25:50.845 --> 25:53.596
I hesitated to text you because of all that.

25:56.041 --> 26:00.686
I want something real.

26:09.146 --> 26:12.198
But I was on a dating app, too?

26:14.444 --> 26:16.121
What?

26:18.572 --> 26:21.707
I said I was on a dating app.

26:22.458 --> 26:25.086
So how's that any different?

26:35.863 --> 26:37.924
The sting is gone now,

26:37.924 --> 26:40.581
but I'm completely wide awake.

26:55.542 --> 26:58.003
I said I was on a dating app.

26:58.003 --> 27:00.496
So how's that any different?

27:01.333 --> 27:05.023
When you eat too much, your stomach hurts,

27:05.023 --> 27:07.420
but when your heart aches,

27:09.208 --> 27:11.716
your nose tingles.

27:26.709 --> 27:28.357
Okay.

27:28.968 --> 27:30.429
Notebook and pen? Okay.

27:30.429 --> 27:32.563
I'm allowed to make mistakes.

27:32.563 --> 27:34.108
But I learn from every single one.

27:34.108 --> 27:35.775
Okay.

27:35.775 --> 27:38.213
But the most important thing is,

27:38.213 --> 27:39.869
if I don't know, I ask.

27:39.869 --> 27:42.330
- Faking it is the worst thing you can do.
- Excuse me.

27:43.167 --> 27:44.701
Hello.

27:44.701 --> 27:47.204
Was that your first-day speech?

27:47.204 --> 27:48.708
Yes.

27:48.708 --> 27:49.989
Add one more thing to that.

27:49.989 --> 27:53.454
Even if things go sideways, don't panic.

27:53.454 --> 27:54.488
Okay.

27:54.488 --> 27:57.219
- Let's go in.
- Okay.

28:03.140 --> 28:05.709
Sae Byeok, you're the new girl?

28:05.709 --> 28:07.584
What happened to the hotel?

28:07.584 --> 28:11.859
My internship's over.

28:14.000 --> 28:16.880
What happened to your arm?

28:16.880 --> 28:18.889
Oh, this,

28:18.889 --> 28:23.446
it was pouring, the ground was slick,
and I wiped out.

28:23.446 --> 28:25.341
Sae Byeok, seriously, be careful.

28:25.341 --> 28:26.400
Oh, I will.

28:26.400 --> 28:28.417
So what year were you born?

28:28.417 --> 28:30.041
'99? Or '98?

28:30.041 --> 28:32.604
Oh, I was born in 2000.

28:32.604 --> 28:33.790
So you're the youngest.

28:33.790 --> 28:35.584
Yu Been's going to love that.

28:35.584 --> 28:36.944
Sim Sae Byeok.

28:36.944 --> 28:39.125
- Oh, yes?
- Come this way to sign your contract?

28:39.125 --> 28:41.305
Oh, yes, of course.

28:42.458 --> 28:44.475
I told you to be careful.

28:47.542 --> 28:51.190
- Don't panic.
- Don't flinch either.

28:54.436 --> 28:56.362
Your hours are flexible,

28:56.362 --> 29:00.515
but keep the same rhythm as everyone.

29:00.515 --> 29:02.611
It gets pretty rough around here,

29:02.611 --> 29:05.572
so save the good outfits for weekends.

29:05.572 --> 29:07.240
Got it.

29:07.240 --> 29:09.334
That hoodie looks great on you, by the way.

29:09.334 --> 29:11.436
- I bet you hear that all the time.
- Oh, thanks.

29:11.436 --> 29:13.116
- That's actually a first.
- A first.

29:13.116 --> 29:15.665
Alright, here's the woodshop.

29:15.665 --> 29:18.128
You'll learn by working with Tae Seop,

29:18.128 --> 29:19.584
- and let's do a welcome party soon.
- Sounds good.

29:19.584 --> 29:20.750
Bo Yoon, Jin Su.

29:20.750 --> 29:22.596
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

29:26.458 --> 29:28.436
Have a seat.

29:30.039 --> 29:32.212
- 1,300.
- 1,300.

29:32.212 --> 29:33.241
450.

29:33.241 --> 29:34.721
What's all this for?

29:34.721 --> 29:36.621
We're building a custom chair for you.

29:36.621 --> 29:37.841
It's a company tradition.

29:37.841 --> 29:41.667
We're a woodworking studio, after all.
Can't have you sitting in any old chair.

29:41.667 --> 29:44.201
- Sae Byeok.
- Oh, yes!

29:48.698 --> 29:50.121
You remember this soban, right?

29:50.121 --> 29:51.641
Oh, yeah, of course.

29:51.641 --> 29:53.841
Wait, it's already done?

29:53.841 --> 29:55.957
Yeah. We're finishing the inspection today

29:55.957 --> 29:58.001
and it goes to the hotel tomorrow.

29:58.001 --> 30:00.545
Come on, let's do this together.

30:00.545 --> 30:02.420
Your first real task.

30:02.420 --> 30:04.513
Right.

30:07.041 --> 30:08.593
Where to after you check out?

30:08.593 --> 30:10.108
Heading to Dr. Shin's?

30:10.108 --> 30:11.458
No,

30:11.458 --> 30:13.587
Hannam-dong first.

30:13.587 --> 30:15.308
I just want to unwind a little.

30:15.308 --> 30:16.434
You know

30:16.434 --> 30:20.687
this was rough on the company too?

30:20.687 --> 30:22.767
I'm already going through scripts.

30:22.767 --> 30:24.348
Why are there so many, though?

30:24.348 --> 30:26.607
That's after I cut them down.

30:26.607 --> 30:28.573
I think we've really nailed

30:28.573 --> 30:31.333
the Queen of Romance thing this time.

30:31.333 --> 30:32.826
I think Ui Yeong's here.

30:32.826 --> 30:35.002
I'll call you when I get home.

30:35.622 --> 30:37.247
Come on in.

30:37.247 --> 30:38.964
[One, two, three, four]

30:41.104 --> 30:43.588
Just grab the essentials and check out.

30:43.588 --> 30:47.132
We'll have the hotel car bring the rest.

30:47.132 --> 30:48.891
Thank you.

30:54.014 --> 30:56.018
[Seasons of Us]
It's Seasons of Us.

30:58.935 --> 31:01.654
Oh, that...

31:02.724 --> 31:04.384
Ui Yeong, you want it?

31:04.384 --> 31:07.164
Really? You're giving it to me?

31:07.164 --> 31:08.987
You said you're my fan.

31:08.987 --> 31:10.699
Hold on.

31:14.083 --> 31:16.524
Thank you for everything, truly.

31:16.524 --> 31:18.462
Don't mention it.

31:22.543 --> 31:24.920
[To Ui Yeong, May love fill your days
as long as you live]

31:24.920 --> 31:26.729
[From Son Jeong A]

31:35.799 --> 31:37.679
Ui Yeong, what's your Saturday look like?

31:37.679 --> 31:39.400
Let's get food.

31:46.900 --> 31:50.528
- You can check that if you need to.
- Oh, okay.

31:50.528 --> 31:52.139
You still owe me a meal.

31:52.139 --> 31:53.742
I love you,

31:53.742 --> 31:55.958
but a debt is a debt.

31:57.333 --> 31:58.534
Ui Yeong,

31:58.534 --> 31:59.557
you seeing somebody?

31:59.557 --> 32:02.299
Oh, no. No.

32:02.299 --> 32:03.440
Get out there and date!

32:03.440 --> 32:05.901
This gorgeous weather is too good
to spend alone.

32:07.338 --> 32:09.147
Honestly though,

32:09.147 --> 32:12.509
I can't even read my own heart.

32:12.509 --> 32:16.181
People must've chased you your whole life.

32:16.876 --> 32:19.683
I won't pretend they didn't.

32:19.683 --> 32:21.655
Most people talk about

32:21.655 --> 32:25.063
just knowing when it's the right person.

32:25.063 --> 32:27.484
That's never clicked for me.

32:27.484 --> 32:29.417
For me,

32:29.417 --> 32:31.691
it hits at a specific moment.

32:32.333 --> 32:34.280
That pull you feel toward someone,

32:34.280 --> 32:36.992
the feelings keep stacking up,

32:36.992 --> 32:40.482
and once they tip past a certain point,

32:40.482 --> 32:42.581
from then on,

32:42.581 --> 32:46.239
their absence just aches.

32:46.239 --> 32:48.351
That's when it hits you.

32:50.041 --> 32:52.581
It's him.

32:52.581 --> 32:54.841
A threshold.

32:54.841 --> 32:57.521
- Like an allergic reaction?
- Exactly.

32:57.521 --> 33:00.773
Isn't love just your guard breaking down?

33:02.601 --> 33:04.727
So just keep seeing each other.

33:04.727 --> 33:07.397
Look each other in the eye, talk more.

33:07.397 --> 33:11.109
Don't try to untangle it by yourself.

33:11.109 --> 33:13.869
It gets clearer the more you're together.

33:24.667 --> 33:26.632
Thank you.

33:27.958 --> 33:30.295
The food was amazing.

33:30.295 --> 33:32.648
I had a really good time too.

33:32.648 --> 33:35.349
- Let's meet again.
- For sure.

33:44.491 --> 33:46.395
Alright, see you Saturday.

33:46.395 --> 33:47.721
Think about what you're craving.

33:47.721 --> 33:49.165
Yes!

33:50.917 --> 33:52.917
Something good happen?

33:52.917 --> 33:55.452
What's with you?

34:02.876 --> 34:05.083
Push it all the way back.

34:05.083 --> 34:06.160
I'll handle it.

34:06.160 --> 34:07.709
Standing still is how you help.

34:07.709 --> 34:08.960
- I'll take it.
- Oh, thanks.

34:08.960 --> 34:12.584
- Sae Byeok, gloves.
- Got it.

34:12.584 --> 34:14.138
Here.

34:15.458 --> 34:17.079
You're really not going?

34:17.079 --> 34:20.138
It's the perfect excuse to see her.

34:20.138 --> 34:22.224
Go with Sae Byeok today.

34:22.224 --> 34:23.850
I already did my part.

34:23.850 --> 34:25.320
Your part?

34:25.320 --> 34:28.326
Do more. Don't just roll over like that.

34:28.326 --> 34:31.356
- Sae Byeok.
- Yeah.

34:31.356 --> 34:34.241
Enjoy your first field run.
They're all going to freak out.

34:34.241 --> 34:35.784
Yeah.

34:36.539 --> 34:37.862
Let's go.

34:37.862 --> 34:39.955
Let's go. Come on.

34:58.164 --> 35:00.822
- Hello.
- Hello.

35:00.822 --> 35:02.584
Right this way.

35:02.584 --> 35:05.431
You showed up instead of Tae Seop.

35:05.431 --> 35:07.025
Oh, well...

35:07.025 --> 35:08.834
things got busy at the office.

35:08.834 --> 35:11.403
But look.

35:12.288 --> 35:13.969
Sae Byeok!

35:13.969 --> 35:16.192
Wait, what are you doing here?

35:16.192 --> 35:19.061
I got hired at HOME.

35:19.061 --> 35:20.649
That's incredible!

35:20.649 --> 35:22.609
I never saw this coming.

35:22.609 --> 35:25.609
I didn't see this coming either.

35:25.609 --> 35:28.454
I was so stuck on my flaws,

35:28.454 --> 35:31.449
but Tae Seop saw something in me.

35:31.449 --> 35:34.000
He really pays attention like that.

35:34.000 --> 35:37.631
Good news like this and you held out?

35:37.631 --> 35:39.560
So sneaky. Congrats.

35:39.560 --> 35:42.080
I wasn't hiding it on purpose.

35:42.080 --> 35:44.000
I planned to say it at the party,

35:44.000 --> 35:45.720
but it kept getting postponed.

35:45.720 --> 35:47.420
Wait, the party still hasn't happened?

35:47.420 --> 35:50.208
No, not yet.

35:50.208 --> 35:51.728
Should we get these boxes moved first?

35:51.728 --> 35:53.140
Yeah, this way.

35:53.140 --> 35:55.025
That's such great news, isn't it?

35:55.025 --> 35:57.277
It really is!

35:57.277 --> 35:58.485
One for each of you.

35:58.485 --> 35:59.819
[The Hills Seoul Pop-up Room Whiskey Box]

35:59.819 --> 36:00.655
Have a good one.

36:00.655 --> 36:01.738
- Have a good one.
- See you.

36:01.738 --> 36:03.872
Bye, Sae Byeok.

36:07.440 --> 36:08.440
Let's go.

36:08.440 --> 36:09.201
- Okay.
- Okay.

36:09.201 --> 36:11.441
- Oh, Sae Byeok.
- Yeah?

36:11.441 --> 36:12.915
About the farewell party,

36:12.915 --> 36:15.960
it's not really a sad thing anymore.

36:15.960 --> 36:18.257
- Yeah.
- So why don't we make it bigger

36:18.257 --> 36:19.960
and throw in a welcome party too?

36:19.960 --> 36:22.474
Like a transfer party?

36:23.667 --> 36:25.094
Or not?

36:25.094 --> 36:26.137
I love it.

36:26.137 --> 36:29.682
[Gallery Rye, "Tuning the Everyday" exhibit]

36:29.682 --> 36:32.739
[Inviting Song Tae Seop from HOME]

36:34.520 --> 36:36.200
[Evening Greeting]

36:51.289 --> 36:53.917
Let's take on everything.

36:53.917 --> 36:56.044
Are you busy?

36:56.044 --> 36:57.284
Why, need help?

36:57.284 --> 37:00.671
We need more hands for sanding.

37:00.671 --> 37:03.157
One email and I'm there.

37:03.157 --> 37:04.975
Thanks.

37:18.715 --> 37:20.824
It's getting awfully quiet.

37:31.477 --> 37:33.009
Hello?

37:33.009 --> 37:35.269
Is this Shin Ji Su?

37:35.269 --> 37:37.552
I'm calling about an audition.

37:38.793 --> 37:40.719
Yeah, that's me.

37:42.375 --> 37:44.792
Oh, right.

37:44.792 --> 37:46.767
I'm available.

38:01.916 --> 38:03.818
That pull you feel toward someone,

38:03.818 --> 38:06.532
the feelings keep stacking up,

38:06.532 --> 38:10.333
and once they tip past a certain point,

38:10.333 --> 38:12.125
from then on,

38:12.125 --> 38:15.379
their absence just aches.

38:36.020 --> 38:38.399
[Indigestion]

38:52.786 --> 38:53.826
- Hey.
- Yeah?

38:53.826 --> 38:54.850
So about the party,

38:54.850 --> 38:57.705
Sae Byeok's saying Saturday night

38:57.705 --> 38:59.230
at Songi Spicy Chicken Feet.

38:59.230 --> 39:02.118
Chef and the general manager are in.

39:03.419 --> 39:05.213
Saturday?

39:05.213 --> 39:06.852
I've already got plans.

39:06.852 --> 39:09.311
Okay, I'll ask about a different day.

39:09.311 --> 39:12.000
No. Getting everyone together is hard enough.

39:12.000 --> 39:15.172
I'll come even if I'm running late.

39:15.172 --> 39:17.936
- Then I'll lock it in.
- Yeah.

39:17.936 --> 39:21.111
No date? It's a Saturday.

39:21.979 --> 39:23.108
No.

39:23.108 --> 39:25.024
We broke up.

39:25.024 --> 39:28.118
Oh, I've been dying for a drink. Perfect.

39:29.156 --> 39:31.455
I'm going all out.

39:33.041 --> 39:35.368
I can't choose between you two.

39:35.368 --> 39:39.235
One of you is my lifelong teacher
and the other's my role model.

39:39.235 --> 39:40.975
I can't. I just can't.

39:40.975 --> 39:42.854
You two should just do it together.

39:42.854 --> 39:44.377
- Great job.
- Thank you.

39:44.377 --> 39:47.143
Thank you.

39:47.143 --> 39:48.292
Thank you.

39:48.292 --> 39:50.057
How did it go?

39:54.549 --> 39:57.017
Shin Ji Su, please come in.

39:57.017 --> 39:58.607
Sure.

40:02.709 --> 40:07.025
- Hello.
- Hello.

40:07.025 --> 40:10.030
- This is Shin Ji Su.
- Okay.

40:12.125 --> 40:13.549
Shin Ji Su.

40:13.549 --> 40:14.949
Yeah, I'm Shin Ji Su.

40:14.949 --> 40:18.584
The whole directing team came to your show,

40:18.584 --> 40:21.140
and the mood was right, so they left a card.

40:21.140 --> 40:24.040
You never called, so we assumed you passed.

40:25.543 --> 40:27.672
Thanks. That really means a lot.

40:27.672 --> 40:31.088
I had some stuff come up and left the troupe.

40:31.088 --> 40:33.767
I'm just putting my head down and working hard.

40:34.375 --> 40:36.474
You're into fitness too?

40:36.474 --> 40:38.417
Yeah, just enough to keep myself in check.

40:38.417 --> 40:39.850
I lift weights.

40:39.850 --> 40:41.167
- Weights?
- Yeah.

40:41.167 --> 40:43.594
Shin Ji Su, him.

40:43.594 --> 40:45.649
He's Son Jeong A's kid,
the one in all that mess.

40:45.649 --> 40:48.115
Oh? Yeah, I think that's him.

40:49.167 --> 40:51.903
Well then...

40:51.903 --> 40:53.578
Here's the one.

40:54.613 --> 40:58.492
It's a 2017, roughly 40,000 km on it,

40:58.492 --> 41:00.369
totally clean record,

41:00.369 --> 41:02.497
the outside's spotless,

41:02.497 --> 41:05.493
and it's right in your price range.

41:05.493 --> 41:07.993
Go ahead and take it for a spin.
Right this way.

41:07.993 --> 41:09.913
Okay.

41:09.913 --> 41:13.885
The previous owner was a woman,
so no smoke smell.

41:13.885 --> 41:15.934
Look around, no rush.

42:04.892 --> 42:06.933
[Seasons of Us]

42:08.595 --> 42:12.417
Don't try to untangle it by yourself.

42:12.417 --> 42:15.035
It gets clearer the more you're together.

42:18.239 --> 42:21.315
Head outside when you're set.

42:21.315 --> 42:23.043
Outside?

42:26.584 --> 42:28.499
Lee Ui Yeong!

42:28.499 --> 42:30.212
Hey.

42:31.797 --> 42:34.387
We could've just met at the restaurant.

42:38.885 --> 42:40.347
What's this car?

42:40.347 --> 42:41.765
It's mine.

42:41.765 --> 42:45.894
- What?
- I need room in the back for work.

42:45.894 --> 42:47.750
So what about the bike?

42:47.750 --> 42:50.245
Just hop in, come on.
Let's go have a good time!

42:50.245 --> 42:52.072
Watch your head.

43:04.644 --> 43:06.774
You're my first passenger.

43:06.774 --> 43:08.416
Feel special.

43:08.416 --> 43:10.882
Sure, I'm flattered.

43:12.000 --> 43:15.201
- Is the restaurant far from here?
- Why?

43:15.201 --> 43:19.820
Our team's got a goodbye dinner for the intern.

43:19.820 --> 43:22.167
I figured we'd eat nearby,

43:22.167 --> 43:24.080
so I told them I'd swing by after.

43:24.080 --> 43:25.301
It's still early.

43:25.301 --> 43:27.641
Even with food and coffee,

43:27.641 --> 43:29.281
we'll be back by 7 or 8.

43:29.281 --> 43:32.140
Oh, that's plenty of time then.

43:36.750 --> 43:37.860
Hey...

43:37.860 --> 43:39.744
I got so used to you

43:39.744 --> 43:42.701
looking all worn out and dying for coffee.

43:42.701 --> 43:44.666
You actually look pretty today?

43:45.792 --> 43:47.544
Where's that coming from?

43:49.292 --> 43:52.090
I mean, obviously better than my work look.

43:52.090 --> 43:54.124
I should've tried harder too.

43:54.124 --> 43:57.387
I didn't want to overdo it and look desperate.

44:15.876 --> 44:18.333
- Yeah.
- Hey, Tae Seop.

44:18.333 --> 44:19.946
When did you clock out?

44:19.946 --> 44:21.028
You stayed late?

44:21.028 --> 44:23.072
Yeah, I helped the team with their work

44:23.072 --> 44:25.577
and brainstormed furniture for the exhibit.

44:25.577 --> 44:27.500
Oh, but for the magazine,

44:27.500 --> 44:29.742
can I reuse what I showed at the fair?

44:29.742 --> 44:31.182
Ideally you'd have something fresh.

44:31.182 --> 44:32.477
Throw in one new piece at least.

44:34.327 --> 44:36.548
Oh, and did you pick tonight's dinner spot?

44:36.548 --> 44:37.837
No, Sae Byeok picked it.

44:37.837 --> 44:41.049
Hey, look sharp tonight.

44:41.049 --> 44:43.635
The boss has to look good
so Sae Byeok feels she joined the right place.

44:43.635 --> 44:46.860
Oh, please. Do I seriously have to show up?

44:46.860 --> 44:50.248
Obviously. The boss can't miss a welcome party.

44:50.248 --> 44:52.893
I'm bringing Sua with me.

44:52.893 --> 44:56.154
- Alright. See you there.
- Yeah, later.

45:05.584 --> 45:07.415
Try this one too.

45:08.576 --> 45:10.556
Quit fussing over me and eat yours.

45:10.556 --> 45:12.796
Watching you eat fills me up.

45:12.796 --> 45:14.195
That's such a lie.

45:14.195 --> 45:16.002
You'll go home and make two packs of ramyeon.

45:16.002 --> 45:18.235
Wait, that's not a bad idea actually.

45:18.235 --> 45:21.589
Ramyeon after meat is the perfect closer.

45:21.589 --> 45:22.616
Can't argue with that.

45:22.616 --> 45:23.696
I want jjajang ramyeon

45:23.696 --> 45:25.776
with a fried egg on top, runny.

45:25.776 --> 45:27.686
Okay, runny.

45:28.584 --> 45:31.140
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

45:31.140 --> 45:33.676
This table's a bit wobbly.

45:33.676 --> 45:35.877
Sorry about that. Let me move you over there.

45:35.877 --> 45:37.696
Thank you.

45:43.292 --> 45:45.120
- All good.
- All good.

45:51.577 --> 45:53.096
What?

45:54.330 --> 45:57.044
It's nothing. Let's eat.

45:59.880 --> 46:01.170
It's been a while.

46:01.170 --> 46:03.490
[Songi Spicy Chicken Feet]

46:03.490 --> 46:05.027
Oh, you're here?

46:05.027 --> 46:07.037
How come you're not going in?

46:07.917 --> 46:09.607
Hey, Sua.

46:09.607 --> 46:11.247
Welcome aboard, congrats.

46:11.247 --> 46:13.041
Can't wait to see how you do.

46:13.041 --> 46:15.066
Yeah.

46:15.709 --> 46:18.848
I'm worried about what you'll be like
when you grow up.

46:18.848 --> 46:21.448
Sae Byeok, how'd you score this spot?

46:21.448 --> 46:23.148
Oh, some of my old coworkers...

46:23.148 --> 46:27.625
- My former colleagues are regulars here.
- What?

46:27.625 --> 46:29.657
Are you okay with spicy chicken feet?

46:29.657 --> 46:30.741
No, I'm totally fine.

46:30.741 --> 46:32.823
I suggested we all get together.

46:32.823 --> 46:35.329
They were throwing a goodbye thing too.

46:35.329 --> 46:37.764
We're not strangers, so the more the merrier.

46:37.764 --> 46:39.604
Always butting in where nobody asked.

46:39.604 --> 46:41.124
Ui Yeong said she's coming, right?

46:41.124 --> 46:43.799
She's got something first,
so she's running late.

46:43.799 --> 46:45.503
Oh, is that so?

46:45.503 --> 46:49.917
She'll be a little late,
but she said she's coming. Let's go in.

46:49.917 --> 46:53.225
- Let me make a quick call and I'll be in.
- Yeah, go ahead.

46:53.225 --> 46:55.839
- I'm here.
- Our little Sua!

46:55.839 --> 46:58.579
Gosh. You're here.

46:58.579 --> 47:00.019
Oh, our baby girl.

47:00.019 --> 47:02.792
You look more like your dad every day.

47:02.792 --> 47:05.198
We've got a big group today.

47:05.198 --> 47:07.111
A hotel buddy's now our newest hire,

47:07.111 --> 47:08.699
so we're doing a little celebration.

47:09.488 --> 47:10.885
Could you watch Sua for us?

47:10.885 --> 47:13.138
She's in good hands.

47:13.138 --> 47:16.958
- Let's have a lot of fun together tonight.
- Yes!

47:16.958 --> 47:20.578
So, she'll be coming, too?

47:20.578 --> 47:22.675
Oh, yeah.

47:25.004 --> 47:26.417
What a surprise!

47:26.417 --> 47:27.584
- Hello...
- What a surprise!

47:27.584 --> 47:29.167
I never thought I'd see this day...

47:29.167 --> 47:31.969
Why are you doing this?
Use your words, not your hands.

47:31.969 --> 47:33.780
- Did you skip out on a tab?
- No, it's not that...

47:33.780 --> 47:37.350
- I'll cover it.
- He's never paid once.

47:41.876 --> 47:45.323
Today's the day. It really is.

47:47.625 --> 47:50.029
Careful.

47:50.029 --> 47:53.715
You're his mom? I thought you were his sister.

47:53.715 --> 47:57.753
We're treating tonight. Dig in, everyone.

47:57.753 --> 47:59.610
We brought the company card too, though.

47:59.610 --> 48:01.123
No, tonight's on me.

48:01.123 --> 48:03.208
I'll only charge for the drinks on the table.

48:03.208 --> 48:06.131
Everything else, help yourselves.

48:06.131 --> 48:07.375
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

48:07.375 --> 48:09.423
I'll enjoy it.

48:09.423 --> 48:11.800
No rush, Tae Seop.

48:11.800 --> 48:15.221
Ui Yeong's still a ways out,
so drink some water.

48:15.221 --> 48:16.881
- Thank you.
- No rush.

48:16.881 --> 48:17.904
This is so good...

48:17.904 --> 48:21.647
- General manager, care to say something?
- Me?

48:24.149 --> 48:26.273
Gosh.

48:26.273 --> 48:29.319
It's the middle of summer, sun's not down yet,

48:29.319 --> 48:33.144
but our evening's officially begun.

48:33.144 --> 48:37.344
I've been at this for nearly 40 years,

48:37.344 --> 48:40.457
and I've never seen a transition this seamless.

48:40.457 --> 48:42.915
Every moment together was real,

48:42.915 --> 48:46.064
and that's why we can smile saying goodbye.

48:46.064 --> 48:47.617
Take care.

48:47.617 --> 48:49.375
Take good care of our Sae Byeok.

48:49.375 --> 48:50.459
- Absolutely.
- Of course.

48:50.459 --> 48:54.625
- Sae Byeok, you better eat and live well!
- Take care of yourself.

48:54.625 --> 48:56.125
All the best, Sae Byeok.

48:56.125 --> 48:58.938
- Glad to have you!
- Glad to have you!

49:00.667 --> 49:03.151
Here you go.

49:04.000 --> 49:06.022
Bottoms up!

49:06.022 --> 49:08.000
The person next to me drinks!

49:08.000 --> 49:10.458
Wait, is that me?

49:10.458 --> 49:13.077
I'm definitely not walking home tonight.

49:34.246 --> 49:35.726
Here.

49:35.726 --> 49:37.013
Yeah.

49:37.013 --> 49:38.645
Thanks.

49:46.311 --> 49:48.863
So how was the audition?

49:50.125 --> 49:52.575
It was awkward. First time, you know.

49:53.606 --> 49:55.529
They told me if I really want to act,

49:55.529 --> 49:57.486
I need to get rid of my tattoos.

49:57.486 --> 49:59.246
Apparently hiding them adds to the budget.

49:59.246 --> 50:01.793
Even the tattoos?

50:03.069 --> 50:05.838
You sure you can handle all that?

50:06.666 --> 50:07.729
Handle what?

50:07.729 --> 50:11.049
I don't know, it feels like a lot.

50:11.049 --> 50:16.055
The tattoos, the auditions, plus the car.

50:16.055 --> 50:18.935
There's no rush, you know.

50:20.375 --> 50:21.829
I'm good.

50:21.829 --> 50:23.935
Don't worry about me.

50:23.935 --> 50:26.943
Once I commit, I'm good at everything.

50:27.749 --> 50:32.026
I bet I killed that audition, honestly.

50:32.026 --> 50:33.612
Yeah, I'm sure you did.

50:33.612 --> 50:36.744
You definitely crushed it.

50:44.792 --> 50:47.334
Hey, Sae Byeok,

50:47.334 --> 50:50.066
why isn't Ui Yeong here yet?

50:50.066 --> 50:52.667
She's still not here?

50:52.667 --> 50:55.600
Excuse me, I asked first.

50:55.600 --> 50:57.591
Sir.

50:57.591 --> 51:00.584
I'll try reaching out

51:00.584 --> 51:01.929
to Ui Yeong.

51:01.929 --> 51:03.834
Tell her the drinks are getting warm.

51:03.834 --> 51:04.890
Cheers!

51:04.890 --> 51:08.735
- It's HOME style.
- HOME style? Gosh.

51:52.250 --> 51:53.946
How about...

51:54.750 --> 51:56.741
How about today?

51:57.368 --> 51:59.202
Did I do okay?

52:03.388 --> 52:05.083
Lee Ui Yeong!

52:05.083 --> 52:06.528
Yeah.

52:06.528 --> 52:08.252
I'm asking

52:09.167 --> 52:11.468
if I did okay.

52:11.468 --> 52:13.876
If I did,

52:13.876 --> 52:15.676
give me something for it.

52:16.667 --> 52:18.262
Actually,

52:21.750 --> 52:23.726
I'll just take it from you.

52:28.125 --> 52:29.774
I'm sorry.

52:39.416 --> 52:41.285
You did

52:42.292 --> 52:44.409
great today.

52:44.409 --> 52:46.124
But

52:47.958 --> 52:50.292
I keep thinking

52:50.292 --> 52:52.839
about someone else.

52:56.835 --> 52:58.511
Ji Su.

53:00.167 --> 53:03.266
- I like Tae Seop.
- You never felt

53:04.333 --> 53:06.686
anything for me?

53:11.478 --> 53:13.685
But once you've made up your mind,

53:13.685 --> 53:16.028
don't hold back. Come find me.

53:17.333 --> 53:19.958
I don't want

53:19.958 --> 53:23.536
to make Tae Seop wait anymore.

54:10.186 --> 54:11.606
When are you coming?

54:11.606 --> 54:13.584
Tae Seop doesn't look so great,

54:13.584 --> 54:16.748
I think he's only sticking around
because of you.

54:16.748 --> 54:19.851
[Song Tae Seop]

54:29.181 --> 54:32.026
I feel like playing basketball.

54:32.026 --> 54:33.500
Basketball.

54:33.500 --> 54:35.292
- Hyun Min.
- Yeah.

54:35.292 --> 54:36.476
Another round?

54:36.476 --> 54:37.751
Let's head to the second spot!

54:37.751 --> 54:39.475
- Time for round two!
- Oh, count me in.

54:39.475 --> 54:42.401
- Yeah, I'm up for it.
- I'll drop Hyun Min off,

54:42.401 --> 54:44.135
so you all go enjoy yourselves.

54:44.135 --> 54:48.000
She looks grown up, but she's a total child.

54:48.000 --> 54:49.636
Do you need a lift too, Chef?

54:49.636 --> 54:52.000
I've already called a cab.

54:52.000 --> 54:53.496
But Ui Yeong hasn't arrived.

54:53.496 --> 54:54.703
Ui Yeong.

54:54.703 --> 54:56.356
- You gave me a fright!
- I'm in big trouble.

54:56.356 --> 54:58.167
Man, you startled me!

54:58.167 --> 55:00.375
- I'm totally finished.
- Why?

55:00.375 --> 55:01.584
How come?

55:01.584 --> 55:02.796
- Hey, Jin Su!
- Yes?

55:02.796 --> 55:04.971
Use this for the next round.

55:08.375 --> 55:11.185
- Start getting ready to leave.
- Yes.

55:17.250 --> 55:20.061
Excuse me.

55:20.061 --> 55:22.050
Tae Seop left, right?

55:22.050 --> 55:24.250
I have no idea either.

55:24.250 --> 55:27.194
But why didn't she come?

55:27.194 --> 55:31.914
Sua passed out while playing.
Take her home right away.

55:33.958 --> 55:35.835
I'll be heading out now.

55:37.160 --> 55:39.561
- I think chicken is the way to go.
- Oh, is that so?

55:39.561 --> 55:40.881
Then chicken over yukhoe...

55:40.881 --> 55:43.381
Sae Byeok, you just don't know any better.
We have to get yukhoe.

55:43.381 --> 55:46.005
- We have to get yukhoe.
- But chicken's probably tastier, though?

55:46.005 --> 55:48.917
- Since you're new, you don't know.
- Sae Byeok!

55:48.917 --> 55:49.925
Hello.

55:49.925 --> 55:51.208
[Songi Spicy Chicken Feet]
Ui Yeong.

55:51.208 --> 55:52.720
Ui Yeong.

55:52.720 --> 55:55.301
I've missed you. Why did you get here so late?

55:55.301 --> 55:57.380
My bad, am I too late?

55:57.380 --> 55:59.167
You've had quite a bit to drink.

55:59.167 --> 56:02.061
We've had a few drinks.
We're on to round two, join us!

56:02.061 --> 56:03.689
Oh, well...

56:03.689 --> 56:05.527
where's Tae Seop?

56:05.527 --> 56:09.945
Oh, Tae Seop? Well, as the boss,
he's at the office...

56:09.945 --> 56:12.083
No, not at all.

56:12.083 --> 56:14.312
He's gone home.

56:14.312 --> 56:16.449
So he's home and not working?

56:16.449 --> 56:18.896
He likely went home, didn't he?

56:20.330 --> 56:22.868
Sae Byeok, I'll visit you soon.

56:22.868 --> 56:23.959
- I'll see you later.
- Okay.

56:23.959 --> 56:25.709
- Look after Sae Byeok for me.
- Yes.

56:25.709 --> 56:26.917
- I'll reach out soon.
- Bye now!

56:26.917 --> 56:28.763
Get home safely.

56:34.806 --> 56:36.743
Thank you.

58:01.041 --> 58:02.958
I can hold on.

58:02.958 --> 58:06.569
Once I commit to something,
I'm surprisingly good at being patient.

58:07.521 --> 58:09.401
No way...

58:16.947 --> 58:20.427
[Songi Spicy Chicken Feet]

58:38.917 --> 58:41.103
What... what is this?

58:51.667 --> 58:53.574
Ui Yeong.

58:55.527 --> 58:56.574
Yeah!

59:01.158 --> 59:03.368
Want to go on a date after work?

59:03.368 --> 59:05.373
A date?

59:05.373 --> 59:07.963
I tried to hold back, but I needed to see you.

59:11.713 --> 59:13.673
I have feelings for you.

59:13.673 --> 59:16.889
I'm so glad we found each other now.

59:18.542 --> 59:21.018
But once you've made up your mind,

59:21.928 --> 59:24.313
don't hold back. Come find me.

01:00:21.333 --> 01:00:23.539
Am I dreaming?

01:00:26.417 --> 01:00:28.328
No,

01:00:28.328 --> 01:00:30.212
it's not a dream.

01:00:33.417 --> 01:00:35.175
You're here?

01:00:37.087 --> 01:00:39.603
Have you been here all along?

01:00:39.603 --> 01:00:41.682
You weren't taking my calls.

01:00:42.846 --> 01:00:45.862
Even if the weather's great,

01:00:45.862 --> 01:00:48.234
you can't just sleep here.

01:00:48.234 --> 01:00:52.774
I passed out in the car for a bit,
but no one was left.

01:00:52.774 --> 01:00:56.940
I stayed so you'd have company.

01:00:56.940 --> 01:01:00.068
What if I hadn't shown up?

01:01:00.068 --> 01:01:02.194
I heard you'd be here.

01:01:02.194 --> 01:01:05.164
So I just waited.

01:01:07.654 --> 01:01:08.958
You know...

01:01:08.958 --> 01:01:11.587
Do you know

01:01:12.314 --> 01:01:16.258
how scary waiting is?

01:01:23.182 --> 01:01:25.184
Just give me a second.

01:01:36.750 --> 01:01:39.907
Why don't you just have some water?

01:01:44.863 --> 01:01:46.997
Should I join you for a drink?

01:01:47.824 --> 01:01:49.872
No.

01:01:51.292 --> 01:01:54.943
I need some guts right now,

01:01:54.943 --> 01:01:57.966
and you must

01:01:58.572 --> 01:02:02.554
remember my words.

01:02:06.250 --> 01:02:07.818
Hey...

01:02:15.958 --> 01:02:17.528
I...

01:02:18.635 --> 01:02:21.240
I'm not here for the farewell party.

01:02:23.493 --> 01:02:27.621
You told me that

01:02:29.750 --> 01:02:33.292
once I'm sure about my feelings,

01:02:33.292 --> 01:02:37.256
I should come and let you know first.

01:02:38.599 --> 01:02:40.718
That's exactly why I'm here.

01:02:42.250 --> 01:02:45.681
To tell you how I feel.

01:02:52.667 --> 01:02:54.773
I like you.

01:02:57.958 --> 01:02:59.695
I also

01:03:00.901 --> 01:03:03.208
like you,

01:03:03.208 --> 01:03:04.992
Tae Seop.

01:03:09.083 --> 01:03:11.123
I missed you

01:03:12.625 --> 01:03:14.626
so much I couldn't take it.

01:03:15.750 --> 01:03:18.005
That's why I'm here.

01:03:29.458 --> 01:03:31.351
I'm glad you are.

01:03:36.958 --> 01:03:38.717
Stay by my side

01:03:40.125 --> 01:03:42.196
from now on.

01:04:36.075 --> 01:04:40.616
[I'll keep waiting]

01:04:44.375 --> 01:04:47.962
[This feeling is a first]

01:04:47.962 --> 01:04:52.307
[When love becomes clear]

01:05:01.642 --> 01:05:05.088
[I like you]

01:05:10.000 --> 01:05:11.141
These are for you,

01:05:11.141 --> 01:05:12.621
to celebrate us.

01:05:12.621 --> 01:05:15.901
Yeah. Anything's possible.

01:05:15.901 --> 01:05:17.876
A boyfriend?

01:05:17.876 --> 01:05:20.542
You can't just write off apps as shallow.

01:05:20.542 --> 01:05:22.584
You know how many creeps
turn up on blind dates?

01:05:22.584 --> 01:05:24.666
How many blind dates have you been on?

01:05:24.666 --> 01:05:25.709
A few.

01:05:25.709 --> 01:05:29.045
So, you're the one who got cast
through Son Jeong A's connections.

01:05:29.045 --> 01:05:30.255
Where are you going?

01:05:30.255 --> 01:05:31.271
No way...

01:05:31.271 --> 01:05:32.917
- A blind date?
- A blind date?

01:05:32.917 --> 01:05:35.134
Let go!

01:05:35.134 --> 01:05:36.935
Tae Seop.
